<title>TUNISIA: Tunisia buys 100,000 tonnes durum wheat - trade.</title>
<headline>Tunisia buys 100,000 tonnes durum wheat - trade.</headline>
<dateline>TUNIS 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tunisia purchased four lots of 25,000 tonnes each of optional durum wheat for March-May shipment at $198.85 to $186.00 per tonne C&amp;F at a tender on</p>
<p>Thursday, traders said on Thursday.</p>
<p>They detailed the purchase as follows-</p>
<p>-20-31 March  25,000 at $198.85  Origin: U.S.</p>
<p>-10-20 April  25,000 at $194.37  Origin: U.S., Canada</p>
<p>    -01-10 May    25,000 at $188.00  Origin: U.S., Canada,</p>
<p>						 Mexico, Syria, EU</p>
<p>    -20-31 May    25,000 at $186.00  Origin: U.S., Canada,</p>
<p>						 Mexico, Syria, EU.</p>
<p>--Tunis newsroom, 2161-787538</p>
</text>
